  data: {
    LLM: '1. Before deal: Each player contributes 1 chip to the pool\n2. Deal: 13 cards to each player\n3. If a player has four of a kind: No play occurs; highest four of a kind wins all 4 chips\n4. Otherwise: Players sort hands into up to four 3-card combinations\n5. Discard face down any cards not part of valid combinations (each card used in only one combination)\n6. Showdowns occur in order: strongest combination first, then second strongest, etc.\n7. Winner of each showdown takes 1 chip from the pool',
